WEBVTT

00:13.480 --> 00:15.670
<i>You mean... a smithy?</i>

00:15.670 --> 00:19.540
<i>Yes. We'd like for you to 
build a mythril workshop.</i>

00:20.160 --> 00:23.150
<i>I've heard that there was one 
in this village long ago.</i>

00:25.210 --> 00:29.300
<i>So, he wants me to find it and revive it?</i>

00:33.410 --> 00:35.510
Master smiths of Campbell Town!

00:36.450 --> 00:38.000
Keep your hands moving!

00:45.060 --> 00:48.310
Thanks for all your hard work. 
You can leave the rest to us.

00:48.630 --> 00:50.270
Oh, but... Um, I...

00:50.270 --> 00:53.370
Are you people able to arrange 
for smiths on your own?

00:53.370 --> 00:55.240
Well, Mister Bestfred said that...

00:55.240 --> 00:57.530
Don't worry! I have them all ready!

00:58.010 --> 01:01.680
You people can just go home 
and prepare our meals.

01:01.680 --> 01:02.450
What?

01:03.050 --> 01:04.280
It can't be...

01:05.620 --> 01:11.800
A mere D-rank would never interfere 
with a B-ranker's plans, would he?

01:29.270 --> 01:33.650
<b>Chillin'</b>

01:29.270 --> 01:33.650
<b>in My 30s after Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</b>

02:46.800 --> 02:49.810
Well, they must be panicking a bit right now.

02:50.370 --> 02:53.340
The Mythril Mine will bring huge profits.

02:53.340 --> 02:57.820
Defense of the mine was the one thing 
that Campbell Town had a piece of.

02:58.400 --> 03:01.070
Now that they've lost that, they're on edge.

03:01.360 --> 03:02.690
<i>So...</i>

03:02.690 --> 03:06.160
<i>They lost their jobs as guards because of me.</i>

03:06.160 --> 03:07.660
<i>I did a bad thing there.</i>

03:09.130 --> 03:11.080
Mister Dariel!

03:11.080 --> 03:13.060
Please help me!

03:13.060 --> 03:15.830
Wh-What's happened?

03:16.340 --> 03:17.100
Huh?

03:18.340 --> 03:21.590
An old man who's visiting the 
village touched my chest.

03:21.590 --> 03:23.720
<i>May he die ten thousand deaths.</i>

03:24.160 --> 03:25.800
<i>He's actually dead?!</i>

03:26.350 --> 03:28.470
<i>Oh. It's just tomatoes.</i>

03:29.290 --> 03:30.790
Ow, ow, ow...

03:30.790 --> 03:34.370
Honestly, it was just your chest.
 What's all the fuss?

03:38.510 --> 03:40.440
That sentiment crosses a line, old man.

03:41.070 --> 03:42.450
What's wrong with you?

03:42.780 --> 03:45.660
Bringing this incompetent 
adventurer back with you...

03:46.640 --> 03:47.790
Incompetent?

03:48.120 --> 03:50.290
I will not forgive you for 
belittling Mister Dariel!

03:51.450 --> 03:52.900
Malika!

03:52.900 --> 03:55.940
Seeing that dull sword of 
his tells me everything.

03:55.940 --> 03:56.540
Sword?

03:56.840 --> 03:59.800
It's rattling. That means you've
 over-sharpened it.

04:00.270 --> 04:02.620
Someone who'd entrust their 
lives to something like that...

04:02.620 --> 04:04.510
If that's not incompetent, then what is?

04:04.510 --> 04:07.550
Even with that sword, 
Mister Dariel is incredibly strong!

04:08.160 --> 04:11.200
Just the other day, he beat 
up a big group of soldiers!

04:11.200 --> 04:15.310
And before that, he defeated 
a giant snake this big!

04:15.310 --> 04:18.480
What? With that dull blade?

04:18.480 --> 04:20.500
Hey, incompetent. Put out your hand.

04:20.500 --> 04:21.320
My hand?

04:22.390 --> 04:23.500
Huh? Oh...

04:23.500 --> 04:24.570
When I do this...

04:25.120 --> 04:28.080
I can tell the type and nature of your Aura.

04:29.510 --> 04:30.950
This is...

04:30.950 --> 04:31.700
What?

04:33.310 --> 04:35.710
Smash! Sting! Hit! Guard!

04:35.710 --> 04:38.960
<b>Guard</b>

04:35.710 --> 04:38.960
<b>Slash</b>

04:35.710 --> 04:38.960
<b>Sting</b>

04:35.710 --> 04:38.960
<b>Hit</b>

04:35.710 --> 04:39.550
You have maximum power in all of them!

04:43.440 --> 04:45.150
On top of such good news,

04:45.150 --> 04:48.800
to think I'd suddenly meet someone 
who possesses Aura like this!

04:48.800 --> 04:49.890
Who are you?

04:50.790 --> 04:51.350
Behold!

04:54.420 --> 04:57.230
I am the mythril smith, Smith!

04:57.670 --> 05:00.680
I heard that forging 
mythril is possible here,

05:00.680 --> 05:02.740
so I came to have some fun.

05:02.740 --> 05:05.740
<b>Episode 5</b>

05:02.740 --> 05:05.740
<b>Dariel Fights in a Duel.</b>

05:06.360 --> 05:08.490
I've never heard of a smith like him.

05:08.490 --> 05:12.910
And Smith is such a common name,
 it's obviously fake!

05:12.910 --> 05:13.700
Oh!

05:14.100 --> 05:18.250
Excuse me! Have you heard of a 
mythril smith named Mister Smith?

05:18.250 --> 05:20.170
Now, there's a name that's a tongue-twister.

05:20.670 --> 05:23.920
What's this, boy? You doubt me?

05:25.550 --> 05:29.440
I've come at the direct 
request of the Center Guild!

05:29.440 --> 05:30.510
It's true.

05:30.510 --> 05:31.910
Which is why...

05:31.910 --> 05:33.350
we're going right now!

05:34.000 --> 05:34.680
What?

05:34.680 --> 05:36.720
Where's the smithy?

05:37.280 --> 05:38.970
We can't.

05:38.970 --> 05:39.770
What?

05:40.080 --> 05:44.280
The smithy is being run by adventurers 
from Campbell Town right now.

05:44.900 --> 05:45.760
It can't be...

05:45.760 --> 05:49.030
They're higher ranked, 
so they won't listen to you?

05:49.030 --> 05:50.280
It's not something like that, is it?

05:50.560 --> 05:51.530
Um...

05:52.390 --> 05:54.240
Pathetic!

05:54.560 --> 05:57.040
I shall show you my negotiation skills!

05:57.330 --> 05:58.810
They're the real thing.

05:59.620 --> 06:01.790
L-Let go of me!

06:01.790 --> 06:04.510
Please, don't say that!

06:03.900 --> 06:06.470
This geezer just won't...

06:04.800 --> 06:08.470
Sir, just once before I drop dead...

06:08.470 --> 06:11.370
I want to touch some mythril!

06:11.370 --> 06:12.990
S-Stop this!

06:12.990 --> 06:15.500
Ugh. That alcohol I had earlier is...

06:16.650 --> 06:20.480
A-All right! Use a corner of the 
smithy or something and get to work!

06:20.480 --> 06:22.980
Thank you so very much!

06:22.980 --> 06:24.790
<i>That's just despicable!</i>

06:25.930 --> 06:27.490
Wow.

06:29.490 --> 06:31.900
Now, this takes me back.

06:33.060 --> 06:33.990
Oh!

06:34.410 --> 06:36.640
A bumper crop!

06:36.640 --> 06:38.750
<i>Bumper crop? Of mythril?</i>

06:39.110 --> 06:40.320
Blast it!

06:41.180 --> 06:42.790
Another failure.

06:43.700 --> 06:45.720
Hmph, rank amateurs.

06:45.720 --> 06:49.150
These little guys require a 
specific processing method.

06:49.150 --> 06:50.300
Processing method?

06:52.550 --> 06:54.010
Make it darker, please.

06:54.010 --> 06:56.090
I'll show you how to treat 
these ladies right.

06:56.090 --> 06:56.720
What?

06:59.470 --> 07:00.270
Are you paying attention?

07:00.610 --> 07:03.340
First, temperature of the fire is important.

07:03.340 --> 07:06.270
If it's too high or too low, 
the mythril will turn to ash.

07:07.710 --> 07:08.530
Now.

07:09.090 --> 07:10.120
This is the color!

07:10.120 --> 07:11.280
Wow!

07:11.810 --> 07:13.970
What is that bright light?

07:13.970 --> 07:15.280
Pressure points.

07:17.040 --> 07:19.400
The pressure points vary from piece to piece.

07:19.400 --> 07:23.290
If you don't determine where they are first, 
it'll end up like what we saw before.

07:23.770 --> 07:29.300
That's why with mythril, what can be made 
from it is predetermined from the beginning.

07:29.570 --> 07:31.360
Watch closely!

07:31.360 --> 07:34.340
This is the superior technique 
of the great Smith!

07:42.420 --> 07:43.400
Here.

07:47.060 --> 07:48.230
It's so light!

07:48.690 --> 07:50.650
Try sending your Aura through it.

07:51.190 --> 07:52.560
Y-Yes, sir.

07:57.190 --> 07:58.160
This is...

07:58.160 --> 08:01.040
It's like silk floss soaking 
up water, isn't it?

08:01.040 --> 08:04.880
With a mythril weapon, your Aura's ability 
to permeate it is completely different.

08:07.080 --> 08:08.890
Next, a test cut!

08:11.320 --> 08:12.950
<i>I didn't feel any resistance!</i>

08:14.720 --> 08:16.720
<i>This mythril sword is insane!</i>

08:18.140 --> 08:19.100
Old master!

08:20.090 --> 08:22.730
I apologize for my earlier rudeness!

08:23.280 --> 08:25.730
I see that you are a renowned master smith.

08:26.270 --> 08:28.180
Please, will you teach us?

08:28.180 --> 08:29.940
Don't wanna!

08:30.370 --> 08:32.440
Earlier, you wouldn't stop 
throwing your weight around!

08:32.810 --> 08:36.160
And it's shameless for an inept, 
rank amateur to even ask!

08:37.340 --> 08:39.660
Just leave him and let's go!

08:40.310 --> 08:43.680
<i>I think he went a little too far, but...</i>

08:43.680 --> 08:44.160
<i>Oh!</i>

08:45.470 --> 08:48.170
How dare a mere D-ranker...

08:48.410 --> 08:50.170
<i>What? Me?</i>

08:50.860 --> 08:53.670
Ah! I feel so much better!

08:53.670 --> 08:55.720
This is the best!

08:55.720 --> 08:57.730
<i>I feel tired for some reason.</i>

08:57.730 --> 08:58.680
Now, then.

08:59.230 --> 09:01.320
Time to give me back the sword.

09:01.320 --> 09:03.220
What? You're not giving it to me?

09:03.220 --> 09:05.690
Don't be stupid. You're not
 a good match at all.

09:10.380 --> 09:13.190
Instead, listen to my dream.

09:14.160 --> 09:15.150
I wanted...

09:15.670 --> 09:19.600
one day, to use mythril 
to make something that

09:19.600 --> 09:22.410
wasn't a sword, spear, axe, 
or like any other weapon.

09:23.030 --> 09:24.710
I-I see.

09:24.710 --> 09:27.140
And then I came to this village...

09:27.140 --> 09:29.670
and I could envision what 
it was I wanted to make.

09:30.400 --> 09:32.880
So, stick with me...

09:32.880 --> 09:33.670
won't you?

09:34.860 --> 09:36.170
All right.

09:36.500 --> 09:39.680
For the moment, what you 
need is more mythril, right?

09:39.680 --> 09:41.930
And a workspace...

09:43.300 --> 09:47.180
In all the confusion, 
I pocketed a bit of mythril.

09:48.250 --> 09:50.280
And I've readied a workshop.

09:50.280 --> 09:51.190
What?

09:55.440 --> 09:56.910
When did you do this?

09:56.910 --> 09:59.510
I had my apprentice cart it here.

09:59.510 --> 10:00.970
And that...

10:00.970 --> 10:02.690
That's an ethanol furnace, isn't it?

10:02.690 --> 10:03.790
You know what it is?

10:04.060 --> 10:07.290
<i>Well, I mean, it's a piece 
of magical equipment!</i>

10:07.760 --> 10:10.650
Well, they are sold on the 
black market sometimes.

10:10.650 --> 10:14.100
But this won't work unless you 
pass magical power through it.

10:16.230 --> 10:18.050
That's exactly right.

10:18.050 --> 10:21.310
If this thing would only work!

10:21.310 --> 10:23.660
I'd be just one step away 
from achieving my dream!

10:25.640 --> 10:28.560
You're right. I did give 
you a communication device.

10:29.030 --> 10:31.310
But I'm busy, so this timing is problematic.

10:31.310 --> 10:33.340
I'm sorry, Rizet!

10:33.340 --> 10:35.350
Here, I hope you'll all enjoy this.

10:35.350 --> 10:36.780
Thank you so much!

10:37.100 --> 10:38.240
Big Bro!

10:38.240 --> 10:39.950
I brought the synthesis ingredients for...

10:39.950 --> 10:41.740
You're the only one I can depend on!

10:42.050 --> 10:44.030
A-All right.

10:45.940 --> 10:47.600
I'm sorry, Big Bro...

10:47.600 --> 10:50.030
I'm so useless.

10:50.030 --> 10:52.250
Gashita, you're in the way, standing there.

10:52.500 --> 10:55.710
So, this is your demon friend?

10:55.960 --> 10:57.480
Y-Yes.

10:57.480 --> 11:00.000
He told me what this is 
about over the communicator.

11:00.000 --> 11:02.430
And since it's a request from Dariel...

11:03.000 --> 11:04.560
But just once.

11:04.560 --> 11:07.110
I can't assist in the mass 
production of weapons for humans.

11:07.110 --> 11:08.930
I'd never mass produce.

11:09.540 --> 11:12.270
It wouldn't count as 
repaying my gratitude then.

11:12.270 --> 11:12.940
Gratitude?

11:13.270 --> 11:15.390
I heard from the Center Guild.

11:15.390 --> 11:20.950
They said that the person who returned 
the mine to us was a man named Dariel.

11:21.910 --> 11:26.410
Once a smith has touched mythril, 
iron just isn't good enough anymore.

11:26.410 --> 11:30.380
That sound. That feel! Not a day 
went by that I didn't remember!

11:30.380 --> 11:31.220
But...

11:32.070 --> 11:34.670
You gave me back my dream!

11:35.070 --> 11:38.670
Dariel, you have a special Aura.

11:38.670 --> 11:44.180
So a weapon that suits you will be something
 no one's seen before, something amazing!

11:44.820 --> 11:46.180
But back then...

11:46.180 --> 11:48.720
Don't be stupid. You're not
 a good match at all.

11:49.030 --> 11:50.730
That was a prototype.

11:51.060 --> 11:53.980
The weapon I am going to make now 
will be for one person alone...

11:54.740 --> 11:58.320
The most powerful weapon of all, one that 
can make the most of all four traits!

11:58.320 --> 12:00.330
My dream...

12:01.640 --> 12:02.830
Dariel...

12:03.470 --> 12:05.570
My dream is to make your weapon.

12:06.030 --> 12:09.040
<b>Chillin'
 in My 30s after Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</b>

12:10.650 --> 12:12.710
Then, if you would, fiend.

12:12.710 --> 12:13.910
It's "demon."

12:18.010 --> 12:19.800
Is there anything I can help with?

12:19.800 --> 12:22.240
Alcohol! Go bring me some alcohol.

12:22.240 --> 12:24.010
What? Y-Yes, sir.

12:25.520 --> 12:27.740
<i>Is this really going to be all right?</i>

12:29.110 --> 12:30.770
Hey there, D-rank.

12:31.050 --> 12:32.440
Can I have a minute?

12:36.070 --> 12:37.700
U-Um, I...

12:36.770 --> 12:39.040
Do you love it?

12:39.040 --> 12:39.780
What?

12:40.110 --> 12:41.500
This village.

12:41.500 --> 12:43.030
What do you mean?

12:43.440 --> 12:45.910
I thought perhaps you hadn't noticed...

12:46.570 --> 12:48.910
that you're all being tricked.

12:50.300 --> 12:52.410
The Mythril Mine.

12:52.410 --> 12:54.410
You're the one who got it back.

12:54.870 --> 12:59.420
Which means that the profits from the mine 
should be the sole property of Lux Village.

12:59.730 --> 13:03.130
But someone is trying to gobble them up!

13:04.000 --> 13:05.680
The Center Guild!

13:06.010 --> 13:08.430
So... what are you saying, exactly?

13:08.780 --> 13:10.240
Will you join forces?

13:10.240 --> 13:11.430
Um...

13:11.810 --> 13:13.010
I'm sorry,

13:13.010 --> 13:16.000
but Lux Village alone is just too weak.

13:16.650 --> 13:19.440
But with Campbell Town alongside you,
 you'll be able to fight!

13:19.840 --> 13:21.990
We will expect appropriate compensation.

13:21.990 --> 13:25.550
But I can promise you that we will 
treat you far better than they would!

13:25.550 --> 13:26.780
I see.

13:27.500 --> 13:29.260
Then, let's speak with the mayor right away!

13:29.260 --> 13:30.200
I don't want to.

13:31.790 --> 13:35.250
You've hurt the things I love too much.

13:35.250 --> 13:37.220
If we're going to get gobbled up either way,

13:37.220 --> 13:38.920
then I choose the side with a sense of honor.

13:45.940 --> 13:47.180
Pick it up.

13:55.530 --> 13:59.190
Tomorrow morning, I'll be 
waiting in the village square.

14:01.420 --> 14:03.590
He challenged you to a duel!

14:03.590 --> 14:04.190
What?!

14:04.640 --> 14:06.190
I'm sorry.

14:06.650 --> 14:09.240
<i>I didn't know that humans 
had a custom like that.</i>

14:10.130 --> 14:12.620
He's probably after the Mythril Mine.

14:12.620 --> 14:14.410
But Dariel just has to win, right?

14:14.410 --> 14:19.250
A D-ranker going up against a B-ranker 
is like a cat going up against a lion.

14:19.550 --> 14:23.010
And the most terrifying thing of all...

14:23.010 --> 14:25.550
If a life is lost at the end of a duel...

14:25.550 --> 14:27.410
It can't be charged as a crime.

14:29.470 --> 14:33.930
That's why some people use duels to satisfy 
their desire for personal revenge.

14:36.780 --> 14:38.220
What if he backs out?

14:39.070 --> 14:40.840
It's the same as a loss.

14:40.840 --> 14:43.060
Which would mean that the mine passes to—

14:43.060 --> 14:44.980
None of that matters!

14:45.370 --> 14:46.990
Big Bro is what's important here!

14:47.280 --> 14:50.200
And we've managed all this time 
without the mine, haven't we?

14:51.310 --> 14:52.480
You're right.

14:52.480 --> 14:54.850
I'll broach the subject of halting the duel.

14:54.850 --> 14:55.700
No.

14:56.180 --> 14:57.170
I'll do it.

14:58.420 --> 14:59.710
Please, let me do it.

15:01.550 --> 15:04.060
Demon, hurry with the synthesis.

15:04.060 --> 15:04.710
Yes, sir.

15:05.040 --> 15:07.710
Boy, you come out front.

15:08.180 --> 15:11.580
I'll teach you how to use a mythril weapon.

15:20.150 --> 15:21.310
Mister Dariel!

15:22.810 --> 15:24.560
Won't you take a little break?

15:26.070 --> 15:28.470
It's herbal tea with honey.

15:28.470 --> 15:29.620
Thank you!

15:31.480 --> 15:32.320
It's very good.

15:34.460 --> 15:35.650
Mister Dariel...

15:35.650 --> 15:36.300
Yes?

15:36.300 --> 15:39.660
Are you really going to fight in the duel?

15:39.960 --> 15:40.720
Yes.

15:42.220 --> 15:43.490
It made me happy.

15:44.640 --> 15:48.590
Everyone was trying so hard to think of 
something for the sake of someone like me.

15:49.080 --> 15:50.690
That's why I'll fight.

15:50.690 --> 15:51.770
I've made up my mind.

15:54.150 --> 15:56.100
Then, I've made up my mind, too!

15:56.770 --> 15:58.850
Tomorrow's dinner will be stew!

15:59.330 --> 16:01.250
Your favorite, Mister Dariel!

16:03.300 --> 16:06.650
So... you have to make sure you stay safe.

16:07.290 --> 16:07.860
I will.

16:08.150 --> 16:11.490
Then, I'll go and get everything 
prepared for the stew!

16:15.300 --> 16:16.480
Malika...

16:27.160 --> 16:29.090
Well done, showing up instead of running.

16:29.430 --> 16:30.680
Oh, yes.

16:30.680 --> 16:35.590
We have succeeded at developing 
mythril weapons as well.

16:36.180 --> 16:39.040
You had something made 
for you, too, didn't you?

16:39.040 --> 16:40.100
Let's see it.

16:46.960 --> 16:48.610
What? A knife?

16:50.930 --> 16:54.110
I wondered what that arrogant 
geezer would make, but this?

16:54.430 --> 16:57.170
Mayor, what are the rules for a duel?

16:57.170 --> 17:00.870
It continues until one of you surrenders, 
or is unable to keep fighting.

17:01.210 --> 17:05.120
If I decide that something is clearly 
too dangerous, then I will call for a halt.

17:05.680 --> 17:10.060
<i>If I lose, it means abandoning 
the Knockers, who trust me.</i>

17:10.760 --> 17:12.630
<i>And it will close off the 
future of Lux Village.</i>

17:13.360 --> 17:15.430
<i>He isn't someone I can beat if I lose focus.</i>

17:17.810 --> 17:18.660
Begin!

17:19.310 --> 17:22.640
I can wait until you go and 
fetch a proper weapon if you–

17:27.010 --> 17:28.100
What did you do?

17:28.530 --> 17:30.770
If you couldn't see that,

17:31.140 --> 17:32.730
then please say "I surrender."

17:41.050 --> 17:42.700
The blade extends?!

17:44.700 --> 17:45.790
I've got you!

17:47.520 --> 17:49.210
Even while it's still extended?!

17:57.010 --> 17:58.730
Even though they're both mythril?

17:58.730 --> 18:00.600
Mister Dariel's weapon is stronger?

18:00.990 --> 18:02.390
Of course it is!

18:02.390 --> 18:07.000
My Hermes Sword is not 
a simple mythril weapon.

18:07.000 --> 18:11.120
The shape can be changed 
by passing Aura through it.

18:11.120 --> 18:16.110
And with the boy's Aura, there are 
no limits to the forms it can take!

18:20.740 --> 18:23.660
No one will be able to stop him!

18:28.340 --> 18:31.250
Without a weapon, you cannot continue.

18:31.250 --> 18:33.000
I-I'm not done yet!

18:37.580 --> 18:39.340
A mythril long sword?

18:40.430 --> 18:41.890
I'll kill you.

18:42.860 --> 18:45.050
You're the one who stole from me first!

18:45.050 --> 18:46.640
You took my job!

18:47.080 --> 18:50.540
Time and time again, you did 
things you had no right doing!

18:51.280 --> 18:53.060
I couldn't help it.

18:56.180 --> 18:58.700
I wanted to help my friends!

18:59.010 --> 19:00.700
Silence!

19:22.870 --> 19:24.970
He did it. Big Bro won!

19:25.350 --> 19:27.850
My big bro won!

19:36.230 --> 19:38.280
I managed it... somehow...

19:38.620 --> 19:39.440
Yes.

19:39.880 --> 19:41.530
You worked so hard out there!

19:41.980 --> 19:43.300
Well done.

19:48.600 --> 19:50.040
I'm so sorry!

19:50.400 --> 19:53.360
I never imagined that 
things had come to this!

19:53.360 --> 19:54.790
Oh, it's all right.

19:55.410 --> 19:59.300
I will make sure that they and Campbell Town's
guild are severely punished.

19:59.690 --> 20:02.230
Will that be enough for a 
reconciliation between us?

20:03.580 --> 20:05.430
U-Um...

20:05.430 --> 20:07.140
Regarding their punishment...

20:07.140 --> 20:10.010
would it be possible for us to 
determine what it should be?

20:10.010 --> 20:10.890
Yes...

20:11.220 --> 20:15.900
I'd like for them to help repair the 
houses that were damaged in the fight.

20:16.950 --> 20:17.680
What?

20:17.680 --> 20:19.150
Is that all?

20:19.550 --> 20:24.370
Everyone did what they thought was best 
for their hometown and their friends.

20:24.370 --> 20:26.410
Both sides caused problems for the other.

20:29.310 --> 20:30.960
I understand.

20:30.960 --> 20:32.410
Thank you.

20:33.580 --> 20:34.390
Not at all.

20:34.390 --> 20:39.140
To be honest, I don't want to lose 
your trust over what's happened here.

20:40.420 --> 20:43.560
Mister Dariel, you were the one 
who convinced the Knockers,

20:43.560 --> 20:45.930
and you've showed that you can 
settle skirmishes with the demons.

20:46.230 --> 20:47.930
I'm lucky, that's all.

20:47.930 --> 20:50.010
Was that truly all it was?

20:51.520 --> 20:56.070
I feel like finding you was 
the reason I came here.

20:57.810 --> 21:01.930
Mister Dariel, would you like to 
come and work at the Center Guild?

21:14.010 --> 21:16.670
<i>That's incredible! The Center Guild?</i>

21:16.670 --> 21:19.160
<i>You don't get great offers like 
this very often, you know?</i>

21:19.820 --> 21:22.710
<i>It's an offer anyone would be grateful for.</i>

21:23.430 --> 21:25.660
<i>There's just so much I don't know!</i>

21:26.210 --> 21:30.510
<i>If I go to the Center Guild, 
will I be able to learn more?</i>

21:31.370 --> 21:32.920
<i>And my parents...</i>

21:32.920 --> 21:35.060
<i>They must be out there somewhere, right?</i>

21:45.180 --> 21:46.750
Hey, Gashita.

21:46.750 --> 21:48.030
This is a big room.

21:48.610 --> 21:50.190
You don't have to sit 
right next to me, you...

21:50.190 --> 21:50.780
know?

21:52.540 --> 21:53.350
<i>Huh?</i>

21:54.160 --> 21:55.090
<i>Why...</i>

21:55.820 --> 21:57.070
<i>is there a pounded rice cake here?</i>

22:00.090 --> 22:02.500
Good evening, Mister Dariel.

22:04.880 --> 22:08.920
Would it be all right... if we talked a little?

22:08.920 --> 22:10.270
<i>Here?!</i>

23:41.740 --> 23:46.230
Next time on <i>Chillin' in My 30s After 
Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</i>,

23:46.230 --> 23:48.900
"Dariel, Enveloped by Steam."

23:46.230 --> 23:51.070
<b>Episode 6</b>

23:46.230 --> 23:51.070
<b>Dariel, Enveloped by Steam.</b>
